
title: Presidential Desk
is-hand: true
max-cards: 3

= [+ month_name +] [+ year +]

The Presidential Palace, Lima.

Review the government's affairs, draw policy cards, manage APRA's internal politics and decide how to respond to the challenges facing Peru.

Public support: [+ support +]
Party unity: [+ party_unity +]
Democratic legitimacy: [+ legitimacy +]

- @party
- @government
- @next_month

@party
title: APRA and Party Affairs
is-deck: true

- #apra_party_affairs

@government
title: Presidency and Government Affairs
is-deck: true

- #apra_govt_affairs

@next_month
title: Next Month
is-pinned-card: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.time += 1;
Q.month += 1;
if (Q.month > 12) {
    Q.month = 1;
    Q.year += 1;
}
Q.month_name = Q.month_names[Q.month - 1];
Q.party_card_available = 1;
Q.govt_card_available = 1;
Q.decisions_this_month = 0;
!}
go-to: main
